5 achievements</strong>, from clearing Hydrogen to clearing all 72 levels on Impossible.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/382370/extras/21b994efbc40fd868a8196c5b6763941.poster.avif?t=1793941996\" width=640 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/382370/extras/21b994efbc40fd868a8196c5b6763941.webm?t=1793941996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/382370/extras/21b994efbc40fd868a8196c5b6763941.mp4?t=1793941996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/382370/extras/803f4e0d1c984bd588ba79691e6fed9e.poster.avif?t=1793941996\" width=596 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/382370/extras/803f4e0d1c984bd588ba79691e6fed9e.webm?t=1793941996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/382370/extras/803f4e0d1c984bd588ba79691e6fed9e.mp4?t=1793941996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Race yourself, your friends and the world</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medals.</strong> Bronze for clearing a level, silver and gold for clearing it inside a target time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pace race.</strong> During a level the game tells you how many blocks you are ahead of or behind the level's top run, or your own best.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily Challenge.</strong> The same level for every player each day, with fireballs that never run out. The fastest clear wins.</p></li><li><p class=